3 STUDY DESIGN, PROCEDURE AND SAMPLE
The cross-sectional laboratory study was conducted using a between-subject design. The between-subject factor was “condition” (2D, S3D, VR-HMD: Oculus Rift DK2). Dependent variables were simulator sickness, physiological responses and driving performance. Participants arrived, received a short oral briefing, ﬁlled out a demographic questionnaire, and were connected to

